                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da118090-1f33-3f38-8129-08af944b5e03",
                        "entry_id": "c14cfa47-8330-303e-b8b8-10b05b63dfe8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A scent that is added to or layered over another."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6771b882-bfb7-4d49-b914-f9117ef5b31a",
                                "sense_id": "da118090-1f33-3f38-8129-08af944b5e03",
                                "text": "Through the broken windows of the wheelhouse came a stench compounded of bog and decay, the watery overscent of the thrusting river that had lured Sir Walter Raleigh toward a mythical El Dorado."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a542da7-65f3-4fb7-a7e3-c62dff12fb40",
                                "sense_id": "da118090-1f33-3f38-8129-08af944b5e03",
                                "text": "the familiar scent of his skin and the oddly boyish overscent of the wool sweater he wore"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6f0c969-5575-4ea8-8e99-5c57c51e9a7d",
                                "sense_id": "da118090-1f33-3f38-8129-08af944b5e03",
                                "text": "[…] the stench of imminent death was almost more than I could bear. Worse was the overscent of abandonment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bc8a730-5ed7-4eef-af94-7b7d1ab9cca2",
                                "sense_id": "da118090-1f33-3f38-8129-08af944b5e03",
                                "text": "The air was cool and scented with sandalwood, a bracing, masculine scent. There was an overscent of hashish."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
